#. ここでのルールでは…
msgctxt "0001 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Based on the rules that\n"
"have been laid out for us..."
msgstr ""

#. 共犯したところで、
#. 生き延びる事が出来るのは…
msgctxt "0002 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Even if more than one person is\n"
"complicit in the murder..."
msgstr ""

#. 殺しを実行した
#. １人だけのはず…
msgctxt "0003 | CELES"
msgid ""
"...only the one who actually carried\n"
"out the act can \"graduate\" and survive."
msgstr ""

#. とすると、共犯者の
#. <CLT 9>可能性はありません<CLT>わ。
msgctxt "0004 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Assuming the rule holds true,\n"
"it is simply <CLT 9>impossible<CLT> that two people\n"
"worked together on this."
msgstr ""

#. 確かに…そうだったな…
msgctxt "0005 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "That *is* how the rule was explained to us..."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、それは事件が
#. １つだった場合でしょ？
msgctxt "0006 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But that only really applies\n"
"if there's one murder, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 今回起きた<CLT 9>事件は２つ<CLT>
#. だったのよ？
msgctxt "0007 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"In this case, however,\n"
"there were <CLT 9>two murders<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>言われてみれば…<CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "<CLT 26>When you put it like that...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>可能性はゼロ？<CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "<CLT 26>Are the chances actually zero?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>なるほどな…<CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "<CLT 26>Interesting...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>やっぱクロが２人？<CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "<CLT 26>Can there really be two \"blackened\"?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>もう誰でもいーんじゃない？<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "<CLT 26>Does it actually matter?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
